      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Bank Data Sharing\n\nThe Open Finance Banking Data Sharing capabilities enable secure, consent-driven access to customer banking data. These services empower licensed third-party providers (TPPs) to deliver account aggregation, financial management tools, lending assessments, and value-added digital services.\n\nAll data access operates under explicit customer consent, with granular permission scopes, strict expiry controls, and full auditability.",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Bank Data Sharing",
        "source_repo": "Nebras-Open-Finance/community-standards",
