      "type": "section",
      "text": "Bank Data Sharing > Bank Data Sharing Provider\n\nAccess to the Bank Data Sharing APIs requires the BDSP role. This role must be assigned to your application in the Trust Framework before making any account information requests. See Roles for the full list of scopes and grant types this role permits.",
